# Alpha 1, step D: the model drawn in all views (edges in 2D, shaded faces in 3D), the
# selection in pink. addbox is a test helper until the box tool exists.
addbox 0 0 0 64 48 32
addbox 96 0 0 128 32 96
expect faces 12
expect selected 6
camera 3 35 25 450 60 20 30
wait 3
shot m1-02-two-boxes.png
# Undo removes the second box from every view.
key Cmd+Z
expect faces 6
wait 3
quit
